<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>08 / 教学协同 Agent</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>长期记忆分层与工具编排规则</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 520 }}><svg width={520} height={420} viewBox='0 0 520 420'><rect x='0' y='0' width='520' height='96' rx='8' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='260.0' y='42.0' font-size='22' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>原始记录</text><text x='260.0' y='68.0' font-size='15' fill='#C8DCF2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>作答、笔迹、事件</text><path d='M252 97 l8 8 l-8 8' fill='none' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='0' y='108' width='520' height='96' rx='8' fill='#1B4E8C'/><text x='260.0' y='150.0' font-size='22' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>结构化能力状态</text><text x='260.0' y='176.0' font-size='15' fill='#C8DCF2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>知识点 / 步骤 / 套路掌握</text><path d='M252 205 l8 8 l-8 8' fill='none' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='0' y='216' width='520' height='96' rx='8' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='260.0' y='258.0' font-size='22' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>经确认个人信息</text><text x='260.0' y='284.0' font-size='15' fill='#C8DCF2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>目标、偏好、已核实事项</text><path d='M252 313 l8 8 l-8 8' fill='none' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='0' y='324' width='520' height='96' rx='8' fill='#9FD0F5'/><text x='260.0' y='366.0' font-size='22' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>待验证事项</text><text x='260.0' y='392.0' font-size='15' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>近期上下文与未确认判断</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>六组能力编排</Text><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>查询</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>先查授权范围，按需取详情；保留来源和未核实项。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>解题 / 批改 / 出题</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>使用共用流水线和评分依据，避免在闲聊中另起互相冲突的标准。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>教学与诊断</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>继续正确任务，记录帮助条件和待验证目标。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>计划与干预</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>复用统一预算，区分建议、已安排、已实施和改善证据。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>发布与更改</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>按业务角色、明确授权和预期版本执行，保留对象及结果。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>长任务与产物</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>保存业务任务编号，先恢复后重试，验证结果和文件实际可访问。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：教学协同Agent设计.md §8–§9</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 84 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>